cff-version: 1.2.0
title: DLR Hosting Capacity Simulator
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Tu
repository-code: https://github.com/tubnguyen/dlr-hosting-capacity-sim
abstract: >-
  Quasi-static AC power-flow simulator for hosting-capacity studies on a
  110 kV distribution corridor with dynamic line rating in the loop.
  Implements the IEEE 738-2012 conductor heat balance in both directions,
  three line-rating modes sharing one thermal model, coordinated voltage
  control, a four-level constraint hierarchy and a minimal-curtailment
  search.
keywords:
  - dynamic line rating
  - hosting capacity
  - distribution network
  - power flow
  - IEEE 738
  - pandapower
license: MIT
version: 2.0.0
